      "answer": "533",
      "quote": "The population was 533 at the 2000 census. The unincorporated communities of Red Mound, and Victory are located in Wheatland. According to the United States Census Bureau, the town has a total area of 27.6 square miles (71.5 km²), of which, 26.5 square miles (68.7 km²) of it is land and 1.1 square miles (2.8 km²) of it (3.98%) is water. As of the census of 2000, there were 533 people, 236 households, and 160 families residing in the town.",
